Falsifies `designware_mobile_storage::proofs::a_command_word_sends_only_the_command_asked_for`.

The defect: the write bit follows the block count as well as the direction, so a multi-block
read goes out as a write and the controller sends the buffer's stale contents to the card.

Expected to fail: the assertion that `COMMAND_WRITE` is set exactly on a write, on a read of two
or more blocks.

